00:11:43.279 --> 00:11:45.789
- I maced myself for you.

00:11:45.789 --> 00:11:49.156
I thought we understood
each other perfectly.

00:11:49.156 --> 00:11:50.656
Guess I was wrong.

00:11:57.374 --> 00:11:59.102
- Another who-done-it solved,

00:11:59.102 --> 00:12:01.298
another wrongdoer laid bare,

00:12:01.298 --> 00:12:03.194
another layer of skin peeled away

00:12:03.194 --> 00:12:07.095
from this rotting corpse
we call a student body.

00:12:07.095 --> 00:12:08.345
Till next time.

